note bottom of PasswordRecoveryCommandServiceImpl
  Request Password Reset -> Send Verification Code -> Verify Recovery Code
  -> Reset Password (US16, US17). The account is found by username or e-mail;
  unknown, inactive or e-mail-less accounts get the same answer and no code.
  The code is kept as a BCrypt hash; a new request revokes the previous code.
end note

