note bottom of ReadOnlyAuditorAuthorizationManager
  Users whose only role is ROLE_AUDITOR can read but not write, except
  their own resources (/api/v1/users/me/**: account, password, profile,
  notification preferences and notifications) and report generation.
  Subscription and billing paths require ROLE_QA_MANAGER or ROLE_ADMIN.
end note

