note bottom of UserAccountController
  GET /api/v1/users/me    account of the authenticated user
  PUT /api/v1/users/me    username and e-mail with the current password
       (200 with a new token / 400 / 409 used by another account)
  The token names the user and carries its id: an old token never opens an
  account that later takes the released username.
end note

